{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47554","headline":"七言 六十三 · 吕岩","name":"七言 六十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"星辰聚会入离乡，日月盈亏助药王。\n三候火烧金鼎宝，五符水炼玉壶浆。\n乾坤反覆龙收雾，卯酉相吞虎放光。\n入室用机擒捉取，一丸丹点体纯阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47554.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47554","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}